            "review_title": "Review at Dram Bar",
            "review_text": "Le Noir\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam6 contributions\n0\n2nd home\nNov 2025 • Friends\nThe place feels comfortable and welcoming — just good music, and a cozy atmosphere. The staff were friendly and attentive, and it made me feel at home. I don’t go out often, but this place feels special. I honestly feel like I belong here. Good vibes and nice service.\nValue\nService\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 12, 2025",
