            "review_title": "Review at Dram Bar",
            "review_text": "TheGame666\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam393 contributions\n0\nGreat ambiance. High prices. Average staff.\nDec 2023 • Friends\nThe design is amazing. It is a 5. Meanwhile the prices are a bit stiff. When I say stiff....I mean 900k for 3 Gin Tonic. \nThey said I didn't told them which Gin I wanted so they picked for me. \nIMO, even in Thao Dien, this is high. \n\nWaitress was cold as ice and this is only the way I like my beer. Will not even bring the \"your card is rejected\" moment while it was a problem with their Card Reader Connection. Thanks God only I heard this while i was with friends. Could have been embarassing....I thought it was funny.\n\nWould advise a basic staff training and the place will be easily a 4 or 5, and a must in TD area.\nRead more\nWritten December 16, 2023",
